    "mixed_description": "Every twentieth line is the same C-generated default Tool::Line ownership id1 (121 bytes plus CRLF); other lines repeat plain_line. 500/5000 metadata comments.",
    "edits": "Replace the last α with β and back, preserving byte length and allocation.",
    "critical_limitation": "Identical repeated lines maximize egui paragraph-cache reuse. Mixed ownership id1 repeats too. These fixtures are not unique authored documents or representative native performance acceptance."
