    "excluded": "Native input dispatch, source editor gutter/navigation, GPU rendering, compositor/presentation, scrolling, physical Windows/DPI/IME validation"
  },
  "findings": [
    "Production idle path returns the same Arc<Galley> and avoids cloning or rehashing the complete LayoutJob.",
    "Ownership uses a LazyLock catalogue; no per-marker SharedCatalog reconstruction was found. Existing authoritative ownership checks remain intact.",
    "The compatibility owned LayoutJob API still has O(n) clone cost and is cfg(test); production editor uses galley().",
    "Full source edits still tokenize/format/hash the document. 100k-line optimized stress remains a significant UI responsiveness risk.",
    "Incomplete literal environment scans stop at the first invalid name byte; measured 10x input growth gave approximately 11x CPU elapsed for the tested malformed cases."
  ],
